1
00:00:00,571 --> 00:00:01,881
(Raj:)What do you mean?

2
00:00:04,308 --> 00:00:06,308
(Sheldon:)How many women
have you had dates with?

3
00:00:07,912 --> 00:00:08,912
(Raj:)Eleven.

4
00:00:09,079 --> 00:00:13,149
(Sheldon:)How many of those women did you think
would become your perfect companion?

5
00:00:15,019 --> 00:00:16,659
(Raj:)Eleven.

6
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,530
(Raj:)Wait. Do I count the 200-pound
Sailor Moon girl

7
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:22,330
(Raj:)that Howard and I had
a threesome with at Comic-Con?

8
00:00:25,596 --> 00:00:27,006
(Sheldon:)Sure.

9
00:00:28,165 --> 00:00:31,275
I'll stick with 11.
She liked Howard better.

10
00:00:33,604 --> 00:00:35,514
(Sheldon:)Well, now do you see the problem?

11
00:00:37,107 --> 00:00:40,057
(Raj:)Maybe. I...
I don't know.

12
00:00:40,211 --> 00:00:42,881
It's late, I... I should...
I should go.

13
00:00:47,585 --> 00:00:49,625
(Raj:)Look, I do get what you're saying.

14
00:00:49,787 --> 00:00:52,737
(Raj:)Instead of desperately clinging
to any woman who will go out with me,

15
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:55,060
(Raj:)I need to work
on my fear of being alone.

16
00:00:56,427 --> 00:01:02,027
(Sheldon:)I was trying to suggest
chemical castration, but...

